<rml>
<head>
<title>Physics interactions</title>
<style>
body, div, h1 { display: block; }
body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; font-family: body; color: #edf5f0; font-size: 14px; }
.panel { position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px; width: 300px; max-height: 86%; overflow-y: auto; padding: 18px; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #13242de8; border-width: 1px; border-color: #49636d; pointer-events: auto; }
.eyebrow { color: #8fd7bf; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
h1 { font-family: heading; font-size: 27px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
.intro { color: #b9cdd2; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.label { color: #8fd7bf; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 12px 0 6px 0; }
.value { color: #d7e6de; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px; }
button { display: block; tab-index: auto; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 6px; padding: 9px 6px; font-family: body; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #edf5f0; background-color: #304d5b; border-width: 1px; border-color: #597781; }
button:hover, button:focus { background-color: #496d76; border-color: #b4e1cd; }
button:disabled { color: #809299; background-color: #233c46; }
.legend { position: absolute; bottom: 20px; left: 24px; padding: 10px 14px; background-color: #13242de8; color: #c7d9d8; font-size: 12px; }
scrollbarvertical { width: 8px; background-color: #13242d; }
scrollbarvertical slidertrack { width: 8px; }
scrollbarvertical sliderbar { width: 6px; margin: 1px; min-height: 20px; background-color: #527864; }
scrollbarvertical sliderarrowdec, scrollbarvertical sliderarrowinc { display: none; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .panel { top: 76px; right: 12px; width: 220px; max-height: 58%; padding: 12px; } h1 { font-size: 22px; } .legend { left: 12px; right: 12px; bottom: 12px; font-size: 11px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="panel">
    <div class="eyebrow">SHOWCASE / PHYSICS QUERIES</div>
    <h1>Physics interactions</h1>
    <div class="intro">Two physical CharacterMotors and three navigation agents share the queries. Observe hits, region overlap and trigger lifecycle events. No damage or combat rules.</div>
    <button id="interaction-probe">Probe the selected lane</button>
    <button id="interaction-target">Target: Middle actor</button>
    <button id="interaction-cast">Hit query: ray</button>
    <button id="interaction-region">Overlap: box</button>
    <button id="interaction-pause">Pause routes</button>
    <button id="interaction-reverse">Reverse routes</button>
    <button id="interaction-clear">Clear event counters</button>
    <div class="label">CLOSEST HIT / GOLD</div>
    <div class="value" id="interaction-hit">No probe yet</div>
    <div class="label">REGION OVERLAP / GREEN</div>
    <div class="value" id="interaction-overlap">No overlap sample yet</div>
    <div class="label">TRIGGER / ORANGE BORDER</div>
    <div class="value" id="interaction-events">0 enter | 0 stay | 0 exit</div>
    <div class="value" id="interaction-last-event">No trigger event yet</div>
    <div class="label">STATE</div>
    <div class="value" id="interaction-status">Preparing physical query bodies and navigation...</div>
</div>
<div class="legend">Blue line: selected query lane. Green box / circle: overlap region. Orange: trigger.<br/>Outer lanes: CharacterMotor + gravity. Inner lanes: Crowd + kinematic query shapes.</div>
</body>
</rml>
